# Underrealm Lich: "If you would draw a card, instead look at the top three cards of your library, then put one into your
# hand and the rest into your graveyard" (CR 614.1a, 121.6). "Each draw is performed - and replaced by Underrealm Lich's
# ability - one at a time" (its ruling): Ancestral Recall's three draws are three looks at the top three. Bot1 takes the
